    {
      "id": "datastore",
      "name": "Datastore",
      "version": "1.3.0-rc01",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/datastore#1.3.0-rc01",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>API Changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Use <code>WindowCompat#enableEdgeToEdge(Window)</code> instead of <code>EdgeToEdge#enable()</code> (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/Ibff3ee1970f18642d5be7177c7ee74ea7b0df73e\">Ibff3e</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li><code>androidx.lifecycle:lifecycle-runtime</code> dependency was updated to 2.10.0. This version is required for bundled lifecycle runtime lint checks to run with AGP version 9.5.0-alpha04 or later. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I99bfdb355ffd7f1083dbdac4167b1f5577740116\">I99bfd</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/556807521\">b/556807521</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/e4bd62f853853bf3522ed15681c58ef28b09ed44..4d0747264862afd42f459a30bb19220f1935894a/datastore"
    },
    {
      "id": "paging",
      "name": "Paging",
      "version": "3.5.3",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/paging#3.5.3",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li><code>ItemSnapshotListFlow</code> will no longer throw <code>IllegalArgumentException</code> when a <code>RemoteMediator</code> has reached the end of pagination in either direction and a Header or Footer is converted to a terminal separator. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I821c7ecd7be663f9851d3804bab5795547ef4a4c\">I821c7</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/566336825\">b/566336825</a>)</li>\n <li>When loaded page exceed <code>PagingConfig.maxSize</code>, loaded pages will not drop to under two pages to ensure the viewport is properly populated with data. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I037a0b6b5d203badc7fa5ecb279a67290fe7575e\">I037a0</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/565835910\">b/565835910</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>External Contribution</strong></p>\n<p>Thank you <a href=\"https://github.com/Igorpetinik\">Igor</a> for submitting the bug fix <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/565835910\">b/565835910</a></p>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/a617b93b1fc9fc1d0ce47dc52dd1454ab99823de..0989c329f4dba2ac30bba57247e28fe6d99e1244/paging"
    },
    {
      "id": "tracing",
      "name": "Tracing",
      "version": "2.0.4",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/tracing#2.0.4",
      "detailsHtml": "<h5>Bug Fixes</h5>\n<ul>\n <li>Fixed a race condition when flushing trace packets. (<a href=\"https://r.android.com/4344047\">aosp/4344047</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/7c46f45a1d5c2fbd169f68659e3ab1d615fad01c..6ea7797f7c65bdfa60ae14fe76811070ac60465c/tracing"
    }
  ],
